devkit-embed redistributes, converted to float16, the potion-base-8M
static embedding model by Minish Lab:

- Model: https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-base-8M (license: MIT), revision
  bf8b056651a2c21b8d2565580b8569da283cab23. It is a Model2Vec distillation of
  https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 (license: MIT), whose tokenizer it uses.
- Model2Vec: https://github.com/MinishLab/model2vec (MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Thomas van Dongen).

LICENSE is the MIT license of Model2Vec. The only change is the conversion of the
embeddings tensor from float32 to float16 (scripts/fetch_model.py in the devkit repository).
